{"reviewId": "227867391_83kGN1LUk", "review": {"abstract": "以世界工业化和城市化发展的历史经验来看，从中后期开始，城市化对工业化的拉动作用要大于工业化对城市化的推动作用", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "chapterUid": 7, "content": "买不起好地段的房子，生个娃跟四个养老金供出来的天龙娃比不起教育资源，孩子光宗耀祖考上本科大学没有人脉照样没有工作，自己想着拼拼事业吧农村老家的爹娘又病了没有养老金也没人照顾。往前走是喝不明白的酒局，往左走是油价肉价都涨了但按揭买的房价降了,往右走生的弱娃又在抱怨原生家庭的痛，往后退一步把电动车碰倒了。老农民生下了工人，工人生下了小快递员，这一生也是没有办法。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "7299-7353", "createTime": 1758460895, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 7, "reviewId": "227867391_83kGN1LUk", "userVid": 227867391, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "author": {"userVid": 227867391, "name": "思凡Captain", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0015-dIsUMctxmg4I0960cNZl810/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "思凡Captain", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M12-0-0-E-0-0-0", "desc": "世界读书日", "title": "世界读书日", "levelIndex": 0}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 16, "likes": [{"userVid": 26833324, "name": "吧啦吧啦哒哒哒", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0029-Mp5~UCENpz5FEBF42df2Q10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "吧啦吧啦哒哒哒", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-1000", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 1000}}], "commentsCount": 1, 